```sql
--Description:  
--Thinking process: We want molecules (identified by trade_name) linked to any
--Sanofi-Aventis company in ChEMBL Release 23.  The applicant names vary
--(e.g. “SANOFI AVENTIS US INC”, “SANOFI-AVENTIS US LLC”), but each contains
--both words “sanofi” and “aventis”.  We therefore:
--  • convert applicant_full_name to lower case,
--  • require it to include “sanofi” AND “aventis”,
